# `astro.config.*` and `src/content.config.ts`

- **Site / SEO / sitemap:** `site` in `astro.config.mjs` feeds sitemap and absolute URLs; when changing production domain, also review `src/pages/rss.xml.js` (`site`) and placeholder URLs in `src/components/fundations/head/Seo.astro` (`@lexingtonthemes/seo`).
- **Integrations:** Config wires `@tailwindcss/vite`, `@astrojs/sitemap`, and `@astrojs/mdx`; `markdown` / Shiki options are set in the same file. Do not add integrations that are not already reflected in `package.json` without adding the dependency.
- **Collections:** `src/content.config.ts` exports `collections` with `glob` `base` paths under `./src/content/<folder>`. Adding a collection requires: a folder, a loader entry, `getCollection` usage in pages, and a route + layout — keep all layers in sync.
- **`vite.ssr.noExternal`:** Includes `"zod"` — preserve unless you know the dependency graph change; avoid unrelated config churn.
